    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Conversation is a dangerous game.</i> This short narrative puzzle will submerse you in an atmospheric world of tension-filled sci-fi where manipulating a fractured band of deep-sea divers is the key to survival. Uncover alliances and expose betrayals \u2014 before your leaky sub fills with water, or something even more horrific from the depths silences you all.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/8d485d9c10446d8141f0507ee86f43f4.poster.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/8d485d9c10446d8141f0507ee86f43f4.webm?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/8d485d9c10446d8141f0507ee86f43f4.mp4?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/8cf43456f99142ef077050c9190882c4.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=103 /></span>Pick your mission, and release your submersible SubVee into an unrelenting sea. Will you side with the Surfacers, who keep the dangers of the depths at bay from their overworld city? Or will you align yourself with a diverse cast of misfits from an underwater base, hidden in the deepest fathoms of the dark?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/f2ab6e78902cdc4c9e98b9efade9396f.poster.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/f2ab6e78902cdc4c9e98b9efade9396f.webm?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/f2ab6e78902cdc4c9e98b9efade9396f.mp4?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/18461b8c0df45494874ffd3f31ee3f06.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=89 /></span>Your SubVee is a dilemma to the divers who find you. Follow hints from the surface to offer them the right handles at the right time. You need their agreement to move forward, but it won't come easily. Navigate a dark maze of emotional dynamics to find leverage to guide them toward consensus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/489bdf2d61e7a95e66abd8cda1b84610.poster.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/489bdf2d61e7a95e66abd8cda1b84610.webm?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/489bdf2d61e7a95e66abd8cda1b84610.mp4?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/1a1445dbc28e9a6b1701556dbf841e38.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=99 /></span>Time is limited\u2014your leaky SubVee is slowly filling with water. But something even more sinister lurks in the fathomless deep. Everytime the eldritch shadow of the Krake appears, the divers scatter, only to return and whisper of their missing leader, the enigmatic figure known only as The Mind.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/c8d487970eed3b8ca93da921379239e4.poster.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/c8d487970eed3b8ca93da921379239e4.webm?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/c8d487970eed3b8ca93da921379239e4.mp4?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/d61530baa81e649ec0eca0749b1f3e32.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=89 /></span>Escape your claustrophobic situation by following your directives\u2014or rebel yourself\u2014there are many ways out. And just as many ways to die. As more divers join, and pull you further into their dysfunction, you\u2019ve got to think carefully to anchor your fate. Don\u2019t let the conversation get too deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/dfca9c58e02534751d555f7fae69d520.avif?t=1749679195\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/4e71b96a568d038cb56e6b7a83df2260.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=89 /></span>Read the prequel to surface the origins of The Mind and his underwater renegades. In <i>Subtle Mind</i>, an idle fisherman's impulsive act unravels The Surfacer\u2019s lies, revealing a hidden world beneath the city\u2019s eternal waterfall. Accused of attempted assassination, The Mind enlists the help of a small pet krake to flee his past and murderous pursuers both, sparking a rebellion that leads to the events of <strong>Sub-Verge</strong>. Novella, 74 pg PDF, w/ color illustrations character illustrations from Art Director Tiia Reijonen, available as a separate DLC, alongside the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Psychological Narrative Puzzle:</strong><br><br>Manipulate the conversation\u2014choose the right diver at the right time to gain leverage, unlock secrets, and steer the group toward survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Deep-Sea Tension:</strong><br><br>The ocean is heavy. From the eerie glow of your failing SubVee to the jittery reactions of the divers, every moment builds suspense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Cast of Characters:</strong><br><br>Navigate the fears and agendas of a rag-tag group of rebels, each with their own motivations, secrets, and survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings, Countless Dilemmas:</strong><br><br>Escape to the surface, disappear into the depths, or meet a darker fate\u2014every conversation can pull you toward a different conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Eldritch Horror of the Deep:</strong><br><br>A monstrous presence lurks beneath, a constant reminder of a hidden past. Divers scatter at the mere hint of the Krake\u2019s approach. When will it strike?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Visuals and Haunting Audio:</strong><br><br>Immerse yourself in a world brought to life with evocative art and an ambient soundscape that deepens the tension. Also, weird fish.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Conversation is a dangerous game.</i> This short narrative puzzle will submerse you in an atmospheric world of tension-filled sci-fi where manipulating a fractured band of deep-sea divers is the key to survival. Uncover alliances and expose betrayals \u2014 before your leaky sub fills with water, or something even more horrific from the depths silences you all.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/8d485d9c10446d8141f0507ee86f43f4.poster.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/8d485d9c10446d8141f0507ee86f43f4.webm?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/8d485d9c10446d8141f0507ee86f43f4.mp4?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/8cf43456f99142ef077050c9190882c4.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=103 /></span>Pick your mission, and release your submersible SubVee into an unrelenting sea. Will you side with the Surfacers, who keep the dangers of the depths at bay from their overworld city? Or will you align yourself with a diverse cast of misfits from an underwater base, hidden in the deepest fathoms of the dark?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/f2ab6e78902cdc4c9e98b9efade9396f.poster.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat