 to return and whisper of their missing leader, the enigmatic figure known only as The Mind.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/c8d487970eed3b8ca93da921379239e4.poster.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/c8d487970eed3b8ca93da921379239e4.webm?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/c8d487970eed3b8ca93da921379239e4.mp4?t=1749679195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/d61530baa81e649ec0eca0749b1f3e32.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=89 /></span>Escape your claustrophobic situation by following your directives\u2014or rebel yourself\u2014there are many ways out. And just as many ways to die. As more divers join, and pull you further into their dysfunction, you\u2019ve got to think carefully to anchor your fate. Don\u2019t let the conversation get too deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/dfca9c58e02534751d555f7fae69d520.avif?t=1749679195\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487020/extras/4e71b96a568d038cb56e6b7a83df2260.avif?t=1749679195\" width=800 height=89 /></span>Read the prequel to surface the origins of The Mind and his underwater renegades. In <i>Subtle Mind</i>,